description:
Our client is actively seeking a Legal Secretary for their Bridgewater, NJ office. This full time, direct hire position is currently in office five days a week.
RESPONSIBILITIES: 
Basic office and administrative duties, including typing and word processing, filing, calendaring, digital dictation, file and document management, scheduling client meetings.Prepare, proofread and edit memos, legal documents and general correspondence.Open new matters, including conducting conflict searches; billing;

